<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<div class="container mt-4">
  <%- include('../partials/breadcrumbs', { items: [{ name: 'Privacy Policy' }] }) %>
  <article class="card card-pad prose">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="muted small">Last updated: <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-AU', { day: 'numeric', month: 'long', year: 'numeric' }) %></p>

    <p>This policy explains what information <%= site.name %> collects and how we use it. We aim to collect as little as possible.</p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Ad content</strong> you provide: title, description, category, location, price and photos.</li>
      <li><strong>Contact details</strong> you provide: your name and email address. Your email is used to verify your ad, to send you status updates and renewal reminders, and to relay buyer enquiries. It is never published.</li>
      <li><strong>Technical data</strong>: a one-way, salted hash of your IP address (never the raw address) and basic request data, used for rate limiting and abuse prevention.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How we use it</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To publish and display your ad once a moderator approves it.</li>
      <li>To relay messages between buyers and sellers without exposing email addresses.</li>
      <li>To keep the site safe, including spam and scam prevention.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Sharing</h2>
    <p>We do not sell your data. We share it only with the service providers needed to run the site (for example, email delivery and bot protection) or where required by law.</p>

    <h2>Retention</h2>
    <p>Ads and their photos are retained while the ad is live and for a reasonable period after expiry, then removed. Verification links expire automatically.</p>

    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>You can ask us to remove your ad at any time using the manage link sent with your ad, or by contacting us.</p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>We use a single essential cookie to keep administrators signed in. We do not use advertising or tracking cookies.</p>

    <p class="muted small">This is a template policy provided for the demo build. Review it with a qualified professional before relying on it in production.</p>
  </article>
</div>
<%- include('../partials/foot') %>
